note for users "Logical authority: existing Profile accounts; no collection rename or auth migration."
note for career_goals "One current goal/chat per account; validated saves automatically move the current pointer. Current goals use owner/version CAS edits. Versioned exploration drafts and temporary structured intake records share this collection. Intake promotes the same document into the current goal; no duplicate original-content copy is saved. Draft role/field may be unknown; confirmed role/field are required. Drafts retain adaptive topic context, current focus/question, total_turns and latest 30 turns. Structured progress and bounded evidence only; no raw JD/CV text."

note for interview_research "Immutable public-context revisions; shared seven-day reuse. Private career_state links constrain user reads. Operational research_contexts holds leases/cache pointers. Brave API adapters acquire evidence. Operational LangGraph checkpoints expire after 24h inactivity; current goals persist. Unavailable acquisition preserves saved goals/research."


%% career_state.workspace.edit_draft holds a private structured pending edit and latest question (24h workspace expiry); chat_receipts holds bounded idempotency metadata. No raw JD/chat transcript or new collection is added.

%% Opportunity Intelligence reuses these collections: no duplicate targets/opportunities collection.
%% research_contexts also holds owner/goal/run-scoped durable jobs, command receipts, per-category progress/evidence and public cache leases.
%% Opportunity jobs pin goal_version; stale revisions cannot publish current research links.
%% Public report fingerprints include material structured opportunity context; raw JD/CV/chat remain excluded.

%% Career Discovery: private sessions/jobs and immutable public-evidence snapshots in research_contexts.
%% Both JD and discovery publish via ReviewStore.goal / GoalStore.persist_target.
%% Generic legacy quota tests retain ledger coverage; production model stages use one Gemini client.

%% JD job identity and speculative retrieval are transient until full extraction validates.
%% Matching public-only seeds reuse research_contexts job history/evidence; activities are fixed stage IDs.
%% Raw JD and scope evidence quotes are never checkpointed; domain collections and shared target persistence are unchanged.


